time, no dependencies, meant to be reusable outside TermMark (e.g. in
l3afpad). Reports spans of keywords, strings, comments, numbers and names
(keys, shell variables, INI sections) for sh, C/C++, Python, JavaScript,
JSON, YAML and INI; a state int carries block comments, triple-quoted and
template strings across lines. hl_lang_from_name() takes fence names,
hl_lang_from_filename() file extensions.

tests/highlight_test.cpp checks it.
---
 include/highlight/highlight.h |  68 +++++++++
 src/highlight/highlight.c     | 277 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
