+  blank line closes it. Continuation lines are joined with a space (`setReflow(true)`, the
+  default); with `--no-reflow` they keep the source line break as `"\n"`, like leaf. Two
+  trailing spaces always force a line break. YAML front matter is parsed before the main
+  loop into a `TableToken` with `fill` set (and `keyValue` for 5 keys or more, as leaf does).
+  Emphasis is flattened: nested `**bold *italic***` becomes plain tokens with `InlineStyle`
+  bits, so every `InlineToken` is one run of text. Table layout, cell wrapping and search
+  depend on that.
